OVERVIEW: Launch a custom executable with an ad-hoc Agent Definition.

USAGE: rv workspace custom [--workspace <workspace>] --expected-content-digest-sha256 <expected-content-digest-sha256> [--rows <rows>] [--columns <columns>] [<command> ...]

ARGUMENTS:
  <command>               Absolute custom executable and arguments.

OPTIONS:
  --workspace <workspace> Project directory, not the home directory. Defaults
                          to the current directory.
  --expected-content-digest-sha256 <expected-content-digest-sha256>
                          Expected SHA-256 digest for the ad-hoc definition;
                          launch does not verify the executable image.
  --rows <rows>           Initial terminal rows.
  --columns <columns>     Initial terminal columns.
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

